Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Waylatch: keep a request moving; keep authority human. Fictional walkthrough, real application.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:09.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,Network loss simulated. Preserve the request locally; no server submission or financial action.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.96,0:00:16.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,Actual offline browser reload: the request survives in IndexedDB. Browser observations are local\Nevidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.17,0:00:22.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bounded QR packets carry request data across disconnection. They carry no payment authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.61,0:00:30.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,A second offline browser decodes an actual QR image and reconstructs the packets. Import stays\Nuntrusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.22,0:00:39.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Real local MiniLM inference plus side-by-side context. Semantic cosine is evidence, never a fraud\Nprobability.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:45.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,Related, unrelated or investigate: an advisory disposition never approves either record or executes\Npayment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.84,0:00:52.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Human REVIEW, AUTHORIZE, buyer approval and separate CAPTURE remain required. Judge financial\Ncontrols are disabled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.60,0:01:00.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Separate historical purchase: USD 1.00 simulated funds, completed capture, USD 0.00 real spending.\NNo checkout is reenacted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.14,0:01:07.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,Proof Trail names browser, organization and provider sources. Original seven-event audit links\Nvalidate; missing earlier events stay visible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.17,0:01:14.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,Saved independent PayPal inspection confirms COMPLETED. Viewing this archive makes no provider call\Nand no new purchase.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.29,0:01:27.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Download a sanitized report or independently validate the original SHA-256 chain. An administrator\Ncan rewrite a full database.
